s. Two local brothers [music] sold the family for reward money. Before the police could reach him, Vasudev, the youngest, tracked down the informants and shot him dead. Damodar was hanged in 1898. His brothers followed a year later. One house gave all three of its sons for India's freedom. [music]"}}